              <panel_606263b359b6586dab3c19bcc311fe31 dorExcludeDescription="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guidePanel" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="PN_StaticText_242c8853" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/panel" textIsRich="true" validateOnStepCompletion="{Boolean}false">
                <items jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2">
                  <textdraw_d4f7da1134fa4bb6995fe8f074919dc5 _value="<p>Within the framework of the implementation of the &quot;Agreement for the use of UBS KeyPort (EBICS)&quot;, the Client hereby wishes that access via UBS KeyPort (EBICS) to the manageable accounts be granted to the participants named below, in accordance with the selected level of authorization, respectively for them to be considered technical and/or administrative contact persons in dealing with UBS.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_WithinTheFrameworkOfThe_fe57550d" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <titledraw_f892b2176d96487e9eaa7f7726522b96 _value="<p>1. Technical and administrative contact partner</p>\n" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" headingLevel="4" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="TTL_1TechnischerUnd_06eea6a3" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/titledraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_df677b9ce62d4562af3d4b100872252c _value="<p>A technical and administrative contact partner for client care within the framework of the implementation of the &quot;Agreement for the use of UBS KeyPort (EBICS)&quot; must be defined by the Client below (e.g., for support and service requests). UBS may use the email address or phone number provided to send unencrypted electronic communications, e.g., about system maintenance or interruptions. These communications may make it obvious that the client uses particular UBS products and services, which could allow third parties such as network and service providers to conclude that a banking relationship exists. The client must inform UBS immediately of any changes to this contact partner.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_ATechnicalAndAdministrative_c19930d7" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
